            {
                "entry_id": "95e91156-e6da-398c-aece-d576a9feb5de",
                "word": "candaule",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6ed2caa8-255d-466b-9fc6-050aa3d71f2b",
                        "entry_id": "95e91156-e6da-398c-aece-d576a9feb5de",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "candaules"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "37a036ad-dee8-3361-9d22-7c3d90bdd228",
                        "entry_id": "95e91156-e6da-398c-aece-d576a9feb5de",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne qui, se revendiquant de droite, se soumet en fait aux idées de gauche."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5640f1b9-82e2-4097-acfb-d6894e34b0ed",
                                "sense_id": "37a036ad-dee8-3361-9d22-7c3d90bdd228",
                                "text": "Mais on pourrait dire plus précisément un candaule (avec un c minuscule), comme on dit un narcisse.."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "acbbcf5a-d93f-4f99-a792-d3efd1a09d4f",
                                "sense_id": "37a036ad-dee8-3361-9d22-7c3d90bdd228",
                                "text": "Louis Aliot, vice-président du parti, se voit ainsi accusé d’être un « véritable petit candaule » pour avoir soutenu Mathilde Edey Gamassou, jeune femme métisse victime de racisme sur les réseaux sociaux après avoir été choisie par la ville d’Orléans pour incarner Jeanne d’Arc lors d’une cérémonie de commémoration."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0896a6c-2565-4613-bbde-62315554d7d9",
                                "sense_id": "37a036ad-dee8-3361-9d22-7c3d90bdd228",
                                "text": "Pour un tweet somme toute anodin, dans son style très vif et très franc (au moins avance-t-il toujours à visage découvert), notre ami Jacques de Guillebon s’est vu traiter de tous les noms par une foule masquée d’internautes anonymes : « candaule » (en passe de devenir l’expression la plus agaçante d’une « fachosphère » de plus en plus auto-référencée), traître, vendu, etc."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "18d67fc1-39ad-40dd-9d67-bbd42d4a0bb4",
                        "source_entry_id": "95e91156-e6da-398c-aece-d576a9feb5de",
                        "source_sense_id": "37a036ad-dee8-3361-9d22-7c3d90bdd228",
                        "target_lang_word": "cuckservative",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cuckservative",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "574c3049-ebb0-3150-9e65-4a6903c2caae",
                                        "entry_id": "f4297427-8768-3e87-aa10-667b2ea0c000",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A weak-willed political conservative politician who is willing to capitulate to left-wing political stances."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "neologism",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6abf1f66-6ada-4816-b053-c140f39407b8",
                                                "sense_id": "574c3049-ebb0-3150-9e65-4a6903c2caae",
                                                "text": "Use of the cuckservative hashtag peaked toward the end of last month, when it was used more than 5,000 times in one day, according to data from Topsy, a social media analytics tool."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cac0bbe6-bc9c-46ad-ba45-74a4af4b47b1",
                                                "sense_id": "574c3049-ebb0-3150-9e65-4a6903c2caae",
                                                "text": "Her shtick has always involved cultivating an extreme online persona, and lately that seems to mean deliberately stoking the cuckservative-obsessed crowd, only to distance herself ever-so-slightly when the Twitter fur flies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70d74258-f1ef-434a-a891-c8053127a0c6",
                                                "sense_id": "574c3049-ebb0-3150-9e65-4a6903c2caae",
                                                "text": "“Hey Reddit, I’m Corey Stewart. Republican Candidate for Governor of Virginia and former State Chair for Donald Trump for President,” he began. “The primary election is June 13th. I am opposing the establishment's handpicked candidate, former Bush guy, RNC chairman, and cuckservative, Ed Gillespie.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9bbf5b3-760f-42d8-81d1-b6ff345cadd8",
                                                "sense_id": "574c3049-ebb0-3150-9e65-4a6903c2caae",
                                                "text": "Nothing captured the alt-right mentality better than cuckservative, with its taunt that moderation is unmanly and certain conservative males are cuckolds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
